<title>UK: African Development Bank sets 15 bln yen bond.</title>
<headline>African Development Bank sets 15 bln yen bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond reverse dual</p>
<p>currency bond was announced by sole lead manager Daiwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AFRICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    15 BLN YEN    COUPON   **3.00	MATURITY    09.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE   DUAL CURRENCY ISS PRICE  100.35    PAY DATE    09.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES   ** COUPON PAID IN AUSTRALIAN DOLLARS, REDEMPTION IN YEN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (M) 100	 SALE LIMITS</p>
<p>US/UK/AU/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
